{"lines":[{"t":"Audioscripts","y":0.069549970774656966,"h":0.016423314142845036,"x":0.098708788798996847,"w":0.12151246388753252,"c":1},{"t":"JOE:","y":0.11918604639361818,"c":1,"w":0.032921810150146488,"h":0.008720930389296444,"x":0.10082304546738839},{"h":0.017901159989679449,"t":"Didn't it include dance and singing and animation, as well as live actors?","c":1,"w":0.576391855875651,"x":0.15625334905728872,"y":0.11288057618821068},{"x":0.1561754108211276,"w":0.59298421223958331,"y":0.12710004680147935,"h":0.019665955093078336,"t":"Yes, it did. Lalso want to mention Looking for Richard. Did you ever see it?","c":1},{"h":0.01816479252701797,"c":1,"x":0.15622223658804255,"w":0.65455123901367185,"y":0.14304755680109627,"t":"No, but l've read about it. It was a blend of a documentary with a few scenes from."},{"t":"Richard III, wasn't it?","y":0.16117286932772967,"x":0.15608648331577649,"w":0.16941048940022788,"h":0.016579683593642258,"c":1},{"h":0.021262533953950835,"t":"That's right. It's more a way of looking into how people nowadays connect with the","x":0.15619107790615241,"c":1,"y":0.17251723835582444,"w":0.65469635009765625},{"y":0.18886979349100219,"x":0.15618331331912771,"w":0.63405237833658856,"t":"playwright - the play is really just the starting point. And that'll be where I finish.","c":1,"h":0.019502066891943226},{"x":0.16032340623416028,"c":1,"t":"Well, it sounds as though it'll be very interesting.","y":0.20608678984838569,"w":0.3850420125325521,"h":0.016640496899859802},{"w":0.15488198598225913,"h":0.017077629080369139,"x":0.10464910252112394,"c":1,"t":"SECTION 4","y":0.25775958313564118},{"c":1,"y":0.28167985189619693,"t":"This lecture will be about the science of acoustics, the study of sound, in relation to urban","x":0.10479110046157207,"w":0.70813690185546885,"h":0.01950545923167879},{"w":0.70806467692057296,"t":"environments such as cities. As an acoustic engineer myself, I think this is an area where","y":0.29792720438631903,"x":0.10481175892017025,"h":0.018384722292914657,"c":1},{"h":0.018764955275752393,"x":0.10480274022267812,"w":0.72042449951171872,"c":1,"y":0.31360674596717153,"t":"we're likely to see great changes. In the past, researching urban soundscapes was simple."},{"x":0.10687898908507786,"t":"We measured levels of sound in decibels, so I used to take my sound meter and I measured","w":0.73069630940755204,"y":0.32881558483449036,"h":0.0176231330359361,"c":1},{"x":0.10270631927008708,"c":1,"t":"the noise somewhere, and then I might ask a sample of people to say at what level the sound","y":0.34205205798377558,"w":0.74523427327473957,"h":0.022732668405988976},{"t":"became annoying.","c":1,"h":0.011627907185728592,"w":0.14403292338053386,"x":0.10699588386812674,"y":0.36482558128083253},{"h":0.017389128991656122,"x":0.10689336955269671,"y":0.38307287044791338,"c":1,"w":0.72035593668619791,"t":"With data like this, acoustic engineers have been able to build up what we call noise maps,"},{"h":0.01929651356979023,"c":1,"x":0.10684943768273683,"y":0.39760678333398514,"w":0.72663874308268228,"t":"maps of the sound environment. But actually these aren't a lot of use. What they do show is"},{"x":0.10685073039576007,"y":0.41342455052886229,"w":0.7142385864257812,"c":1,"h":0.018879963455829207,"t":"that the highest noise levels are generally on roads - well, that's not really very surprising."},{"t":"But there's quite a lot going on that these maps don't show, because they can't capture","c":1,"h":0.018880404909311421,"x":0.10689271535543042,"y":0.42945396068975183,"w":0.68950592041015624},{"x":0.10473417307287339,"w":0.71440307617187504,"h":0.021004178077508984,"c":1,"t":"the complex way that sound varies over time. So they ignore important issues such as the","y":0.44307066501604053},{"t":"noise someone might hear from the open windows or gardens of their neighbours, and this","x":0.10477468930385281,"w":0.72047673543294266,"y":0.46001120139411356,"h":0.019099346740506951,"c":1},{"w":0.71217112223307288,"c":1,"h":0.017029271389766953,"t":"sort of noise can be quite significant in summer. We don't have any databases on this sort","x":0.10893339979210699,"y":0.47533004490857234},{"c":1,"h":0.021007409786588327,"t":"of information. As well as that, these records of sound levels take no account of the fact","y":0.48857956665683233,"w":0.69381698608398434,"x":0.10884914809839397},{"w":0.72252217610677083,"h":0.019657980848116985,"t":"that people vary in their perceptions of noise - so someone like me with years of working in","c":1,"y":0.50569680657911198,"x":0.10891768232143638},{"w":0.45095260620117189,"t":"acoustics might be very different from you in that regard.","x":0.10681247991791561,"h":0.018755502779436051,"y":0.52311822820204623,"c":1},{"w":0.73281346638997391,"c":1,"y":0.54423483030351949,"h":0.020400083247567813,"x":0.10889085760047654,"t":"But anyway, even though these noise maps are fairly crude, they've been useful in providing"},{"x":0.10684618438372089,"h":0.019982006580725686,"y":0.5602236163802391,"w":0.71224675496419276,"c":1,"t":"information and raising awareness that noise matters, we need to deal with it and so it's a"},{"x":0.1109358160927862,"h":0.017810191366781969,"w":0.6978279113769531,"y":0.57567582262935157,"c":1,"t":"political matter. And that's important - we need rules and regulations because noise can"},{"x":0.10905350286681037,"y":0.59447674441211518,"h":0.013081394460653373,"c":1,"w":0.22222221374511719,"t":"cause all sorts of problems."},{"y":0.61350327536928773,"w":0.71846598307291665,"h":0.020886790766452057,"c":1,"t":"Those of you who are city-dwellers know that things go on 24 hours a day, so city-dwellers","x":0.10886883802052286},{"x":0.11095827931818443,"y":0.62929063767905169,"t":"often suffer from interrupted sleep. It's also known that noise can lead to a rise in levels of","w":0.71427495320638013,"h":0.017390051213815982,"c":1},{"y":0.64481098760888522,"t":"stress, due to physical changes in the body affecting the composition of the blood. And there","w":0.73488520304361982,"c":1,"h":0.020384978349413774,"x":0.10889758747350224},{"x":0.10889975615318273,"t":"are other problems as well, for instance if schoolchildren don't have a quiet place to study.","w":0.72041997273763025,"y":0.65995000187744912,"h":0.020108911538994634,"c":1},{"w":0.16666666666666669,"x":0.10905349784127999,"y":0.68021201413606003,"t":"their work will suffer.","h":0.013101939458588729,"c":1},{"t":"Now, one problem with decibel measurement is that it doesn't differentiate between different","x":0.10886681088862853,"y":0.69678761620730445,"w":0.73293599446614588,"h":0.022065331152386847,"c":1},{"x":0.10889206582078297,"h":0.021066130962753782,"t":"types of noise. Some types of sounds that most people would probably think of as nice and","y":0.71393654967233577,"w":0.72467219034830732,"c":1},{"t":"relaxing might well score quite highly in decibel levels - think of the sound made by a fountain","x":0.10886515157881727,"y":0.72916388387776598,"w":0.74722696940104161,"c":1,"h":0.020146240755582134},{"t":"in a town square, for example. That's not necessarily something that we'd want to control or","x":0.10886454555789291,"h":0.021610783463512862,"c":1,"y":0.74427316732109761,"w":0.73083028157552077},{"x":0.10890343512747042,"w":0.74517644246419268,"h":0.020647190484899491,"c":1,"t":"reduce. So maybe researchers should consider these sorts of sounds in urban design. This is","y":0.76004951370477569},{"c":1,"h":0.020347923215904284,"x":0.110907468644693,"t":"going to be tricky because just measuring decibel levels isn't going to help us here. Instead.","y":0.77570892074698983,"w":0.73487757364908857},{"t":"many researchers are using social science techniques, studying people's emotional response","y":0.7921828327295195,"x":0.11098637275429563,"w":0.74305989583333343,"h":0.018558100058979177,"c":1},{"h":0.016033872417903772,"x":0.11097580485969871,"c":1,"y":0.81008957200007137,"w":0.35616770426432293,"t":"to sound by using questionnaires and so on."},{"x":0.11091849332886597,"t":"So what exactly do people want to hear in an urban environment? Some recent","y":0.82869279053474698,"w":0.63416305541992191,"h":0.021494881143558686,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.020655305141273783,"x":0.11096486745929411,"w":0.73280354817708337,"y":0.84507753535482222,"t":"interdisciplinary research has come out with results that at first sight seem contradictory - a"},{"c":1,"y":0.86028585832202931,"w":0.71438349405924473,"t":"city needs to have a sense of activity, so it needs to be lively, with sounds like the clack of","x":0.11295545754574031,"h":0.01997271920823096},{"x":0.11296453436367453,"w":0.73692448933919275,"t":"high heels on a pavement or the hiss of a coffee machine, but these mustn't be too intrusive,","h":0.020568795984850063,"y":0.87496943438348485,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.016463660519872803,"w":0.43033152262369789,"t":"because at the same time we need to be able to relax.","x":0.113014525504868,"y":0.89368419001180277},{"x":0.11522633804605263,"y":0.94331395333234358,"w":0.037037035624186185,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"t":"114"},{"c":1,"x":0.39471442319902983,"y":0.96641811836880809,"t":"leltsresources.org","w":0.20846842447916669,"h":0.017805688091947602},{"c":1,"t":"Q30","y":0.12790697658815764,"w":0.037037035624186254,"x":0.85390946563017256,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"y":0.44476744170443672,"h":0.013081395583944611,"x":0.85802469196762121,"c":1,"t":"Q31","w":0.037037035624186254},{"x":0.86213991837903636,"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.65988372074000434,"c":1,"t":"Q33","w":0.037037035624186254}],"w":2400,"h":3395}